  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1321700/description_7b58aa87-a136-4265-9861-190f665db8c4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Create: 不可破坏的下界合金镐</strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>不可破坏的下界合金镐</strong>顾名思义，它正如它的名字所示。这是一把由<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">金</span>和<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">下界合金</span>制成的<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">镐</span>，完全不可破坏！它被设计为非常后期的游戏内容。</h1>\n<hr>\n<p>实际合成配方如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4850288-66ac-4080-ac56-51d9cde9d3f5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"522\" height=\"330\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>祝挖矿愉快！</strong></h1>",
